{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月28日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261028.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】有航空公司及零售商戶先後發生資料外洩事故，客戶接到懷疑詐騙電話，估計外洩的原因是甚麼？商戶如何提升網絡安全措施，以保障客戶私隱？</p><p>周三時事全方位，請來嘉賓討論 。</p><p>題目：個人資料外洩</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:01:16.992704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.557718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:26.603904+00:00","content_hash":"2a47d79bf9505796aec05a3429883079c0bfd1e1fd3285eba7ca3131d7786dad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:01:16.992704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}